{"title": "Cook Trader Table", "pageid": 44914, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cook_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Cook Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Vendor_Cook</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Cook+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Cook+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing a wide variety of <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Cook Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Food\">Food</span></h4>\n<p><i>Rolls eight, nine, or ten times.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>8</td><td>9</td><td>10</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>1/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>1/3</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_3\" title=\"Food Supply Table 3\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_3\" title=\"Food Supply Table 3\">Food Supply Table 3</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cooked_Food_Supply_Table_5\" title=\"Cooked Food Supply Table 5\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/90/FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/FOOD_Mashed_Potatoes_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cooked_Food_Supply_Table_5\" title=\"Cooked Food Supply Table 5\">Cooked Food Supply Table 5</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2/3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cooked_Food_Supply_Table_10\" title=\"Cooked Food Supply Table 10\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png/40px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png/60px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png/80px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png/40px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cooked_Food_Supply_Table_10\" title=\"Cooked Food Supply Table 10\">Cooked Food Supply Table 10</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/3</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715160127\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1428/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13378/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2696/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928275/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.641      1 -total\n 67.94%   22